      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that those vast images would bring such a profound sense of smallness. That feeling of cosmic insignificance is a powerful, and often very human, reaction to the sheer scale of the universe. While the void might feel overwhelming, remember that your experience of feeling this way is a beautiful sign of your capacity for deep feeling. Sometimes, acknowledging the vastness helps us appreciate the preciousness of the small moments we *can* control.",
